# Reaching a live city with the KEYBOARD ALONE - no mouseclick anywhere.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS
# ---------------
# scripts/d_city.script reaches a live city but ends in four `mouseclick right`
# presses. I claimed for a long time that the city-naming screen could not be
# passed without a mouse. That was wrong: I tested one direction, watched the
# cursor not move, and generalised. A human player reached a running city on the
# keyboard, and a brute force against the reference recomp found the route:
#
#   - the naming screen's cursor walks on the d-pad
#   - A is CANCEL, not confirm. A on END returns to MAP SELECT. I read "A did
#     nothing" as "no button works" when it had already navigated away.
#   - B confirms, but only from a CHARACTER key. B on END types a '.'.
#   - to reach END: down once, right eight times, down once, right once
#     (down + 8xright lands on '-', one short)
#   - from END, left nine times lands on Z
#   - B confirms, then "Select game level" appears; B again picks Easy; B again
#     starts the city
#
# The point of this script is not that it works. It is that it removes the mouse
# as a variable. If the city is reachable with the pad alone, then our mouse
# support is not what is holding the clock, and the search for the clock's cause
# can stop treating it as a suspect.
#
# The leading section below is scripts/d_city.script verbatim up to its first
# mouseclick, which is the part already known to reach the naming screen.
wait 250
press start 5
wait 120
press down 5
wait 120
press b 5
wait 120
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
wait 300
press left 5
wait 150
press down 5
wait 90
wait 40
press down 5
wait 25
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press right 5
wait 16
press down 5
wait 25
press right 5
wait 30
press left 5
wait 16
press left 5
wait 16
press left 5
wait 16
press left 5
wait 16
press left 5
wait 16
press left 5
wait 16
